## MANDATORY FEATURE SCAFFOLD (DO NOT DEVIATE)

When adding a new domain resource (e.g. Events), **mirror Users / Roles**. Do not invent alternate folder layouts, controllers without `BaseController`, ad-hoc fetchers, or untyped API calls.

### Gold-standard references
- **CRUD list resource:** Users (`UserController`, `routes/api/v1/users.php`, `pages/user/*`, `services/user.ts`, `types/user.ts`)
- **Settings CRUD resource:** Roles (`RoleController`, `pages/settings/roles/*`, `services/role.ts`, `types/role.ts`) **and** Packages (`PackageController`, `pages/settings/packages/*`, `services/package.ts`, `types/package.ts`)

### A) Backend checklist (every new resource)

1. **Migration** — `database/migrations/..._create_<table>_table.php` (+ alter migrations as needed)
2. **Model** — `app/Models/<Name>.php`
   - `$fillable`, casts, relations
   - Use `SoftDeletes` when trash/restore is required (Users/Roles do)
3. **Enum(s)** (if needed) — `app/Enums/`
4. **Controller** — `app/Http/Controllers/Api/<Name>Controller.php`
   - **MUST** `extends BaseController`
   - Set protected props only where possible:
     - `$model`
     - `$searchableFields`
     - `$sortableFields`
     - `$relationships`
     - `$validationRules` (`store` / `update`)
   - Override `store`/`update`/etc. **only** for domain-specific logic (password hash, role sync, file upload) — still use `$this->successResponse` / `$this->createdResponse` / `$this->notFoundResponse` from traits
   - Inherited from `BaseController`: `index`, `search`, `store`, `show`, `update`, `destroy`, `trashed`, `restore`, `forceDestroy`, `bulkDelete`, `bulkRestore`, `bulkForceDelete`, activity logging
5. **API v1 route file** — `routes/api/v1/<resource>.php`
   - Wrap in `Route::middleware(['auth:sanctum', 'admin.panel'])` **except** (1) the API-key-only public catalog: `GET /events`, `GET /events/{id}`, `GET /event-categories`, `GET /events/{id}/form-fields`; (2) Web App groups `/participant/*` and `/organizer/*` which use `participant.web` / `organizer.web` instead — never `admin.panel`.
   - Permission middleware per action (`permission:view …`, `create`, `edit`, `delete`) — not applied to those three public GETs
   - Standard shape (see Users):
     - `GET /` index, `POST /` store, `GET /{id}` show, `PATCH /{id}` update, `DELETE /{id}` destroy
     - Bulk: `DELETE /bulk/delete`, `POST /bulk/restore`, `DELETE /bulk/force-delete`
     - Soft delete: `GET /trashed/list`, `POST /{id}/restore`, `DELETE /{id}/force`
6. **Register routes** — in `routes/api.php` under `Route::prefix('v1')`:
   ```php
   Route::prefix('<resource>')->group(base_path('routes/api/v1/<resource>.php'));
   ```
7. **Permissions** — add to `database/seeders/RolePermissionSeeder.php` (and reseed / sync as needed). **Every** route `permission:` must exist in the seeder; every seeder permission must be used by a route (API or FE) or be intentionally FE-gated (`view dashboard`, `view trash items`).
8. **Do not** put resource routes only in `web.php`; API belongs under `/api/v1`.
9. **Activity log** — every write (create/update/delete/status/payout/check-in/settings) must call `logActivity` or equivalent `activity()`.

### B) Frontend checklist (every new list/CRUD resource)

1. **Types** — `resources/js/src/types/<name>.ts`
   - Prefer extending `ITimestamped` from `types/common.ts`
   - Export from `resources/js/src/types/index.ts`
2. **Service** — `resources/js/src/services/<name>.ts`
   - **MUST** `extends BaseApi<T>` from `services/baseApi.ts`
   - Constructor: `super("/<resource>")` matching API prefix
   - Export singleton: `export const <name>Api = new <Name>Api()`
   - Add extra methods only when needed (like Organization profile/logo)
3. **Page folder** — `resources/js/src/pages/<name>/`
   ```
   pages/<name>/
     index.tsx                 # list page (Breadcrumb, StatusFilterBar, DataTableWithSidebar, bulk actions)
     show.tsx                  # ONLY if data-volume rule says full page (Events, Organizers, Payouts, Certificates, Feedback)
     components/
       <Name>Detail.tsx        # side panel OR reused inside show.tsx
       <Name>Form.tsx          # create/edit form
       <Name>Modal.tsx         # GenericModal wrapper around Form
   ```
4. **index.tsx pattern** (see `pages/user/index.tsx` for side-panel lists; `pages/event/index.tsx` for full-page details):
   - React Query mutations via `<name>Api`
   - `StatusFilterBar` between breadcrumb and table when the resource has statuses
   - Compact columns: `hideBelow: "lg"` for secondary cols; `formatMoney` + right-align for amounts
   - Side-panel lists: `useSidebarDetail` + `DataTableWithSidebar` sidebar
   - Full-page details: no sidebar; `onRowClick` / view → `navigate("/{resource}/:id")`
   - `useConfirmDialog` for deletes
   - Modal open state + entity-to-edit state
   - Toast via `sonner`
5. **Modal** wraps Form in `GenericModal` (see `UserModal.tsx` / `RoleModal.tsx`)
6. **Router** — register lazy route in `resources/js/src/router/routes.tsx` with `permissions: [...]`
7. **Sidebar/nav** — update `resources/js/src/lib/sidebar.ts` (and i18n keys) when adding nav items

### C) Exceptions (existing, do not force full CRUD scaffold)
- **Auth** — `AuthController` + `routes/api/v1/auth.php` + `services/auth.ts` + `pages/login`, `pages/profile` (not index/Detail/Form/Modal CRUD)
- **Organizer auth** — `OrganizerAuthController` + `organizer-auth.php` (API only; no Web UI yet)
- **Organizer Admin** — identity edit + suspend/reactivate + trash. Password not admin-editable. No admin "create organizer" form (register via organizer-auth).
- **Organizer subscriptions** — Admin **oversight** only (`OrganizerSubscriptionController`): history list, assign, cancel — **not** full CRUD and not Web App self-serve
- **Events Admin Form** — **moderation** only (featured / capacity / status transition / title). **`monetized` is derived from paid ticket types**. Status changes **must** use `POST /events/{id}/transition`. Full event create UI remains Web App (API create exists). Event **hub** is `pages/event/show.tsx` (`/events/:id`), not a sidebar.
- **Ticket types Admin (Prompt 12)** — Full create/edit/soft-delete + disable/enable sales from Event hub Ticket Types tab (`TicketTypeModal`). Force-delete blocked if `quantity_sold > 0`.
- **Discount codes Admin (Prompt 12)** — Full create/edit/soft-delete/activate from Event hub Ticket Types tab (`DiscountCodeModal`).
- **Participations Admin (Prompt 12/13)** — Add (user combobox), promote waitlist, cancel with optional reason on Event hub Registrations tab. **Manual cash payment UI removed** (organizer-scoped; API still exists but rejects admin-panel tokens).
- **Event form fields Admin (Prompt 12)** — Add/edit/reorder/deactivate-or-delete on Event hub Form Fields tab (`FormFieldOversight`). Key immutable on update; deactivate-if-answers rule still applies.
- **Invitation templates Admin (Prompt 13)** — Read-only preview on Event hub Invitation tab (`InvitationTemplatePreview`). Ops store/update API remains; **no designer/edit UI** in Admin (Web App).
- **QR Scan History Admin** — list + side panel + Event hub Overview check-in stats (keep). **No scanner UI was ever built** in Admin. `POST /qr-scan-logs/validate` rejects admin-panel tokens (`action_requires_organizer_scope`).
- **Payments / Payouts Admin** — Platform `/payments` list + **side panel**; Event hub Payments tab + refunds; Payout list + **full page** `/payouts/:id`; finance on Event Overview; Settings commission. Charge UI **never built**; charge/manual reject admin-panel tokens.
- **Event add-ons Admin** — Announcements / Speakers / Sessions / Sponsors as lazy Event hub tabs (`EventAddOnOversight` `only` prop). Certificates re-issue on platform `/certificates/:id`; Event hub no longer dumps all add-ons at once.
- **Feedback Admin (Prompt 13)** — Top-level `pages/feedback/` list + **full page** `/feedback/:id`. Soft-hide via `hidden`.
- **Gallery Admin (Prompt 14)** — List + upload + delete on Event hub Gallery tab.
- **Subscriptions Admin (Prompt 14)** — Platform `/subscriptions` overview + **side panel**; assign/cancel remain on Organizer **full page** `/organizers/:id`.
- **Share Event (spec 12.3 MUST):** **explicitly deferred to Web App pack**.
- **Dashboard** — stats aggregates (`view dashboard`).
- **Organization** — profile/settings style under Settings.
- **Logs** — read-only; `permission:view logs` on all routes.
- **Settings mail / commission** — forms + test; activity via `activity('settings')`.
- **Public API-key-only catalog** — `GET /events`, `GET /events/{id}`, `GET /event-categories`, `GET /events/{id}/form-fields`, `GET /platform/branding` omit `auth:sanctum` / `admin.panel` / permissions. Do **not** copy this for other resources without product intent. Admin Bearer on event URLs still returns unfiltered events / full form schema. Branding returns public display fields only.
- **Web App API (Prompt 0)** — separate route files + `app/Http/Controllers/Api/Web/*`. Do not put organizer/participant Web endpoints on Admin controllers behind `admin.panel`.

### D) Searchable entity picker standard (Prompt 12 — MANDATORY for FK fields)

**Never** show raw `event_id` / `user_id` / `organizer_id` number inputs to admins.

| Piece | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Component | `components/form/FormCombobox.tsx` (wraps Headless UI Combobox; **null-safe** `displayValue`) |
| Helpers | `hooks/useEntitySearch.tsx` — `useEventSearch`, `useUserSearch`, `formatEventOption`, `formatUserOption` (also null-safe; ASCII ` - ` separators) |
| Twin usage | `pages/user/components/UserForm.tsx` (roles); `PayoutRequestModal`; `ParticipationOversight`; QR filters |

**Pattern:**
```tsx
const eventSearch = useEventSearch();
<FormCombobox<IEvent>
  id="…"
  label="Event"
  value={selected} // may be null
  onChange={setSelected}
  onSearch={eventSearch.setQuery}
  options={eventSearch.options}
  displayValue={formatEventOption} // must accept null → ""
  loading={eventSearch.loading}
  placeholder="Search…"
/>
// Submit selected.id to API — never display raw IDs as the primary UI
```

- API: `GET /api/v1/{resource}/search?q=` (Users, Events, Roles, Packages, Categories have search). Do **not** load entire tables into a static `<select>`.
- Contextual FKs (you're inside Event Detail) → omit picker; pass `event_id` from props.
- **Gotchas:** (1) Combobox `displayValue` is invoked with `null` when cleared/unselected — always guard. (2) Prefer ASCII separators in picker label strings (` - `) — Unicode `·` broke Vite Babel parse on this Windows env.
---

## High-Level Architecture

```
Browser → resources/views/app.blade.php → Vite React (resources/js/src)
       → axios /api/v1/* → routes/api.php → routes/api/v1/*.php
       → Api\*Controller (extends BaseController unless Settings)
       → Domain services → Eloquent models → MySQL
```

### Request / auth flow
- Middleware: `EnsureJsonResponse` on API; **`verify.api.client` (`X-API-Key` lookup) on all `/api/*`**; Sanctum `auth:sanctum`; Spatie `permission:`; **`admin.panel`** (`EnsureAdminPanelAccess`: `UserType::ADMIN` + token ability `admin-panel`) on Admin resource routes; **`participant.web`** (`EnsureParticipantWebAccess`: `User` + token ability `web-participant` — admin *users* allowed if the token is web-participant); **`organizer.web`** (`EnsureOrganizerWebAccess`: `Organizer` + `organizer-web`; suspended → 403 `organizer_suspended`).
- **API-key-only (no Bearer) public catalog:** `GET /api/v1/events`, `GET /api/v1/events/{id}`, `GET /api/v1/event-categories`, `GET /api/v1/events/{id}/form-fields`. `EventController` still detects an optional Sanctum `admin-panel` token via `$request->user('sanctum')` so the Admin SPA (API key + Bearer) keeps unfiltered index/show.
- **API key + Bearer (`auth:sanctum` + `admin.panel` + permissions):** every Admin resource route (event search/write/nested, category show/write, users, payments, etc.). Organizer/participant tokens must **not** pass `admin.panel`.
- **API key + Bearer (`auth:sanctum` + `participant.web`):** `/api/v1/participant/*` — see Web API surface below.
- **API key + Bearer (`auth:sanctum` + `organizer.web`):** `/api/v1/organizer/*` and `organizer-auth` me/profile/password.
- Traits on `BaseController`: `ApiResponseTrait`, `ApiFilterTrait`. Web controllers: `WebController` and/or `ResolvesOrganizerEvent`.
- Sanctum abilities: `admin-panel`, `web-participant`, `organizer-web` (plus legacy lock flag string `'locked'` on token JSON — not Spatie).

### Web API surface (Prompt 0 — not Admin SPA)

**Do not change Admin SPA routes or permissions.** Web uses explicit groups. Ownership: never accept `user_id` / `organizer_id` as an ownership selector from Web input. Participant: `$request->user()` (`User`); cross-user → **404**. Organizer: `$request->user()` (`Organizer`); `event.organizer_id` must match; nested resources via `ResolvesOrganizerEvent`; cross-organizer → **404**.

**New Web envelope** (do not rewrite old Admin/public envelopes): `{ success, message, data, status_code }`. Paginated Web lists: `data.items` + `data.pagination: { current_page, last_page, per_page, total }`. Domain errors use `errors.error_code` arrays when a stable code exists.

**Payment distinction:** Participant checkout is `POST /api/v1/participant/payments/charge` (`PaymentService::charge`). Admin `POST /payments/charge` and `POST /payments/manual` remain for historical/ops compatibility but **reject admin-panel** (`action_requires_organizer_scope`). Organizer door cash is **not** yet on `/organizer/*` (gap: `POST /organizer/payments/manual`). QR validate for organizers is `POST /api/v1/organizer/qr-scan-logs/validate` (scanner organizer derived from token; foreign event → `invalid`, no check-in). Admin `POST /qr-scan-logs/validate` still rejects admin-panel.

**Invitation distinction:** Admin Event hub preview stays read-only `GET /events/{id}/invitation-template`. Organizer designer: `GET/POST/PATCH /organizer/events/{event}/invitation-template` (+ optional `.../background` multipart `background`). Participant ticket: `GET /participant/participations/{id}/invitation` (200 with `invitation: null` if none; canvas 800×1100; **no PDF generation**).

**Route files:** `routes/api/v1/participant-web.php`, `organizer-web-core.php`, `organizer-web-content.php`, `organizer-web-ops.php`; required from `routes/api.php` inside v1. Public form-fields registered in `events.php` next to catalog GETs.

**Participant routes** (`auth:sanctum` + `participant.web`):
| Method | Path |
|--------|------|
| GET | `/participant/participations` (`page`, `per_page`, `status`) |
| POST | `/participant/events/{event}/discount-codes/validate` `{ code, ticket_type_id }` — priced quote (`DiscountPricingService`); 404 `discount_not_valid_for_event`; 400 inactive/expired/exhausted |
| POST | `/participant/participations` `{ event_id, ticket_type_id?, discount_code?, custom_field_answers? }` — join via `ParticipationService`; optional code snapshotted on the participation |
| GET | `/participant/participations/{participation}` |
| POST | `/participant/participations/{participation}/cancel` |
| GET | `/participant/participations/{participation}/invitation` |
| GET | `/participant/participations/{participation}/certificate` `{ available, certificate }` |
| GET | `/participant/participations/{participation}/feedback` (own row even if hidden) |
| POST | `/participant/event-feedback` `{ participation_id, rating, comment? }` |
| POST | `/participant/payments/charge` `{ participation_id, payer_phone }` |

**Organizer routes** (`auth:sanctum` + `organizer.web`), prefix `/organizer`:
| Area | Methods / paths |
|------|-----------------|
| Dashboard | `GET /dashboard` |
| Events | `GET/POST /events`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /events/{event}`, `POST /events/{event}/transition` `{ status }`, `POST /events/{event}/banner` multipart field **`banner`** — create is **draft**; `event_mode` required on create; no featured/monetized/organizer_id/status on PATCH |
| Ticket types | `GET/POST /events/{event}/ticket-types`, `PATCH/DELETE /ticket-types/{ticketType}`, `PATCH /ticket-types/{ticketType}/sales` `{ sales_enabled }` |
| Discount codes | `GET/POST /events/{event}/discount-codes`, `PATCH/DELETE /discount-codes/{discountCode}`, `PATCH /discount-codes/{discountCode}/active` `{ active }` |
| Form fields | `GET/POST /events/{event}/form-fields`, `PATCH/DELETE /form-fields/{field}`, `PATCH /events/{event}/form-fields/reorder` `{ ordered_ids }` |
| Speakers / sponsors / sessions | `GET/POST /events/{event}/{speakers\|sponsors\|sessions}`, `PATCH/DELETE /{speakers\|sponsors\|sessions}/{id}` |
| Gallery | `GET/POST /events/{event}/images` multipart field **`image`**, `GET/DELETE /events/{event}/images/{image}` |
| Announcements | `GET/POST /events/{event}/announcements` |
| Participations | `GET /events/{event}/participations`, `GET /participations/{id}`, `POST .../promote`, `POST .../cancel` `{ reason? }` |
| Analytics / finance | `GET /events/{event}/analytics`, `GET /events/{event}/finance` |
| Payouts (per-event only) | `GET /payout-requests`, `GET/POST /events/{event}/payout-requests`, `GET /payout-requests/{id}` — **no** approve/reject/record-payment |
| QR | `POST /qr-scan-logs/validate` `{ token, gate? }`, `GET /events/{event}/qr-scan-logs`, `GET /events/{event}/check-in-stats` |
| Invitation | `GET /invitation-system-templates` (active), `GET/POST/PATCH /events/{event}/invitation-template`, `POST .../background` |
| Packages | `GET /packages` (active catalog with duration + lifecycle flags), `GET /subscription`, `GET /quota`, `POST /subscriptions` `{ package_id, payer_phone? }`, `GET /subscriptions/history`, `GET /subscription-orders`, `GET /subscription-orders/{id}` |
| Auth extras | `PATCH /organizer-auth/profile`, `POST /organizer-auth/change-password` |

**Tests:** `EnsureParticipantWebAccessTest`, `ParticipantWebApiTest`, `ParticipantDiscountApiTest`, `EventModeWhyAttendApiTest`, `OrganizerEventBannerApiTest`, `OrganizerWebCoreApiTest`, `OrganizerWebContentApiTest`, `OrganizerWebOpsApiTest`, `OrganizerSubscriptionPurchaseTest`, `PackageSubscriptionTest`.

**Consciously deferred:** invitation PDF compositing; organizer `payments/manual` Web route; organizer self-charge for tickets; Share Event; Web App UI for package checkout (backend ready).

