| `ticket_type` | text | `x`, `y`, `font_size`, `font_color` |
| `organizer_logo` | image zone | `x`, `y`, `width`, `height` |

Overlay position schema object: `{ x: int, y: int, width?: int, height?: int, font_size?: int, font_color?: string }` — coordinates are pixels relative to the 800×1100 canvas origin (top-left).

### Custom upload requirements (organizer mode = custom)
- **Dimensions:** must match canvas **800 × 1100 px**
- **Formats:** PNG or JPG
- **Max size:** 5 MB (admin system background uploads use the same limit)

### Schema notes
- `invitation_system_templates` — platform library (Admin CRUD). Soft-delete; **force-delete blocked** if referenced by any `event_invitation_templates.system_template_id`.
- `event_invitation_templates` — per-event config:
  - `mode`: `template` | `custom` | `null` (not configured)
  - `system_template_id` (nullable FK, nullOnDelete) when mode=template
  - `background_image_path` when mode=custom
  - **`config`** — legacy JSON kept for backward compatibility (do not remove)
  - **`overlay_positions`** — new positional JSON (Phase 2 designer writes here)
  - **`customizations`** — `{ primary_color, secondary_color, logo_path, header_text, font_family }`

### Admin surfaces
- Settings → Invitation Templates (`/settings/invitation-templates`) — library CRUD
- Event Detail → Invitation template — read-only mode-aware preview

