### 2026-08-26 - Admin SPA first-load / DataTable performance
- **Cause:** In `npm run dev`, Vite was serving huge icon/UI packages (`lucide-react`, `@tabler/icons-react`, Mantine, MUI, etc.) as thousands of unbundled ESM requests on the first visit to a DataTable page (~6k network entries). After the dep cache warmed, later navigations felt fine. Separately, DataTable always wrote URL search params and defaulted React Query to refetch-friendly settings.
- **Fix:** `vite.config.js` `optimizeDeps.include` + `server.warmup` for the Admin entry; React Query defaults `staleTime` 60s / `refetchOnMount|WindowFocus|Reconnect: false`; table hook `staleTime` 2m + stable query fingerprint + `placeholderData`; URL sync only when params change (`replace: true`); page-reset skips no-op `setPage(1)`; entity search min 2 chars + cache.
- Files: `vite.config.js`, `resources/js/src/main.tsx`, `components/datatable/{index,useFetchTableData}.tsx`, `hooks/useEntitySearch.tsx`, `.agent`.
- After pull: delete `node_modules/.vite` and restart `composer run dev:windows` so deps re-prebundle once.

