- **Refund-after-payout decision (CLIENT REVIEW):** Block refund when it would leave collected &lt; reserved/paid-out payouts (no silent clawback). Admin must handle clawback outside this path. API returns `errors.error_code: ["refund_blocked_payout_recorded"]` plus descriptive `message`. No refund admin UI yet (spec 5.9 focuses on recording payouts).
- **Pending stuck path:** Expire after 15 min → payment failed, participation cancelled, ticket released.
